                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Sulemaani, okwiha aha kutandika okuhitsya aha muheru, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'ebyabaireho ekya Nasani nabi, n'omu kitabo ky'obunabi ekya Ahiya owa Shiilo, n'omu kitabo ky'okworekwa ekya Ido omuhanuuzi, aha bya Yeroboamu mwene Nebati?",
          "type": "text",
